---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | findmycompetitor"
  description="Read the privacy policy for findmycompetitor.com. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data."
  canonical="https://findmycompetitor.com/privacy-policy"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-[28px] sm:text-[36px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-1px] text-ink mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[14px] text-mute mb-10">Last updated: June 2025</p>

    <div class="prose-content space-y-8 text-[15px] leading-7 text-body">

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly, such as URLs you submit for analysis. We also automatically collect usage data including IP addresses, browser type, and pages visited to improve our service.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-2 ml-2">
          <li>Provide and improve the competitor analysis service</li>
          <li>Analyze usage patterns and optimize performance</li>
          <li>Communicate service updates (only if you opt in)</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">3. Data Storage & Retention</h2>
        <p>Submitted URLs and analysis results are processed in real time and are not stored permanently. Usage analytics are retained for up to 12 months.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>We use third-party services including analytics providers and cloud infrastructure. These providers have their own privacy policies and may process your data on our behalf.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use minimal cookies to remember your theme preference and language selection. No tracking or advertising cookies are used.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete personal data we hold about you. Contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@findmycompetitor.com" class="text-link hover:underline">privacy@findmycompetitor.com</a> to exercise these rights.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy periodically. Material changes will be noted on this page with an updated date.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:privacy@findmycompetitor.com" class="text-link hover:underline">privacy@findmycompetitor.com</a>.</p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
